      "subtitle": "impl WorkTracker for R: GhRunner",
      "summary": "The first adapter. Every request is one `gh` invocation; argv and JSON payloads are built by pure functions and every response is read by a pure parser, so the adapter is a thin loop over `GhRunner`. Reads verify the project's status field and options before any item page, page through items with a cursor, and refuse a write without an explicit identity.",
