      "lane": "adapter",
      "group": "adapter",
      "subtitle": "run(argv, stdin) / identity()",
      "summary": "The one place the adapter touches a process. `run` returns stdout on success or trimmed stderr on a non-zero exit; `identity` reports the explicit token the runner writes under, and the tracker refuses a write when it is `None`.",
