      "id": "real-gh-runner",
      "label": "RealGhRunner",
      "kind": "service",
      "delta": "added",
      "lane": "adapter",
      "group": "adapter",
      "subtitle": "spawns gh, 60s timeout, GH_TOKEN",
      "summary": "The `GhRunner` over the real `gh` program. Drains stdout and stderr on their own threads, writes stdin on a third, polls the child until a deadline and kills it on timeout. When built with a token it sets `GH_TOKEN` and removes `GITHUB_TOKEN`, so a write never falls back to the ambient login.",
